<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Hyundai Elec 1996 net plunges.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Hyundai Elec 1996 net plunges.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>							 1996	    1995</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				  1,520    vs  18,144</p>
<p>    Net					     71.14 vs     834.60</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)	   10    vs     none</p>
<p>    Turnover				   3,167.24 vs   3,902.13</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			   80.15 vs     996.62</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries (both loss)		1.69 vs	12.03</p>
<p>NOTE - Hyundai Electronics Industries Co is a unit of the makers of computer memory chips. It said its share capital rose by 10 million shares to 28 million in 1996 due to its initial public offering. Company officials said its net profit plunged due to the sharp decline in the price of dynamic random access memory chips.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
